{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297915","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297915","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1029791501:1":{"text":"ソーンも本当にお疲れ様。","source_cn":"这几天真是辛苦了，索恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63AC2DFF8DB7B12F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029791502:1":{"text":"毎日馬車の点検をしたり、道中の強盗と戦ったりで、ちゃんと休めてないんじゃない？","source_cn":"每天都要检查车，如果遇到拦路的还要战斗，好几天都没休息吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AA2C51EF6357AC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029791503:1":{"text":"平気だ。色んな場所で戦えるのは、けっこう楽しい。","source_cn":"还好。能去不同的地方战斗，很有趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1615EDD0CDF61B4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029791504:1":{"text":"むしろ、そっちの方が大変だったろ。","source_cn":"你那边比较辛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x308A2473B1926606","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029791505:1":{"text":"うう……正直、もうクタクタだよ。帳簿の確認とか記帳とか、買い物に来たお客さんには挨拶もしないといけないし！","source_cn":"呜——我确实累死了！要看账，还要记账，如果有人买东西还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3519B0CD3539ABA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029791506:1":{"text":"でもその分、子どもたちもここ最近でかなり成長したんだ！","source_cn":"不过，孩子们最近学了很多东西哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x760662D81DEDDC94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029791507:1":{"text":"計算なんて、すっごく速くて正確なんだよ。","source_cn":"至少算数，又准又快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70559D78381946E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029791508:1":{"text":"たぶん、ソーンより上手になってるかも！","source_cn":"如果现在比赛，估计索恩你可不一定比得过他们了哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28B3B3FF43931985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029791509:1":{"text":"…………\n……だろうな。","source_cn":"…………\\n我……认输。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29A8EFFEF36921CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029791510:1":{"text":"もう、勉強のことになると、途端に負けず嫌いじゃなくなるんだから……","source_cn":"你还真是，在念书上就一点也不好胜了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4BD22DF7F8E9187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"アルサ","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}